NOTICE = "D1 Screening status: Spare Construct is a browser-based sketch and screening tool. It is not an approved regional transport model and it is not the Auckland Forecasting Centre Macro Strategic Model (MSM). Its results are indicative and are intended to scope, test and support a transport assessment. They must be reviewed, and where necessary confirmed with approved tools, by a suitably qualified transport planner or traffic engineer before they are relied on in any resource consent, plan change, notice of requirement, Fast-track application or funding decision.\nD12 Hand-over: This export is prepared for use in SIDRA Intersection. Results produced in that tool, not the Spare Construct estimates, should be reported where the tool is required or accepted by the reviewing authority."
